@prefix : <http://edugraph.io/edu/>.
@prefix edu: <http://edugraph.io/edu#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.

<http://edugraph.io/edu/> a owl:Ontology;
    owl:imports <http://edugraph.io/edu#>.
:AbductiveReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Inferring a plausible explanation for observations from incomplete evidence, while recognizing that other explanations may remain possible.";
    rdfs:comment "proposing a rule that could explain a number sequence, or suggesting a cause for an unexpected experimental result.";
    edu:specializes :NonDeductiveReasoning.
:ActiveVocabulary a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Using a range of words accurately and appropriately to express ideas in speech or writing.";
    rdfs:comment "using geometric terminology in an explanation, or choosing precise descriptive words in a story.";
    edu:specializes :TextualArticulation, :VocalArticulation.
:AdaptiveCreativity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Revising ideas or solutions in response to new information, constraints, or feedback while preserving their intended purpose.";
    rdfs:comment "modifying an experimental design after a failed trial, or revising a story after feedback reveals an unclear motivation.";
    edu:specializes :CreativeCapability.
:AnalogicalReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Drawing tentative conclusions about one situation from relevant similarities with another situation.";
    rdfs:comment "conjecturing that a fraction procedure also works for algebraic ratios by comparing their structures, or using a water-flow analogy to predict circuit behavior. The analogy's limits must still be considered.";
    edu:specializes :NonDeductiveReasoning.
:AnalyticalCapability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Examining information by separating its components, identifying relationships, and evaluating the conclusions they support.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying relevant quantities in a word problem, or comparing the evidence in two historical accounts.".
:Articulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing meaning with clarity and control through a chosen communication modality.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a geometric relationship with a clear diagram, or delivering spoken instructions that an audience can follow.";
    edu:partOf :CommunicationCapability.
:ArtisticInterpretation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting the meaning of creative works through their formal, stylistic, symbolic, and expressive features.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining how imagery contributes to a poem's theme, or how musical phrasing conveys tension.";
    edu:specializes :Interpretation.
:AxiomaticReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Reasoning that establishes, interprets, formalizes, or draws conclusions within a system organized around explicit axioms or foundational assumptions.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying the starting assumptions of a geometric system, or determining which conclusions follow from a formal model.";
    edu:specializes :LogicalReasoning.
:AxiomFormalization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing the foundational assumptions, primitive terms, and rules of an axiomatic system in an explicit and internally consistent form.";
    rdfs:comment "stating geometric axioms precisely, or formalizing the starting assumptions of a model before deriving its consequences.";
    edu:specializes :AxiomaticReasoning.
:AxiomIdentification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing which statements function as foundational assumptions within an axiomatic system.";
    rdfs:comment "distinguishing a geometric postulate from a theorem, or separating a model's assumptions from its predictions.";
    edu:specializes :AxiomaticReasoning.
:BiasDetection a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying prejudice, favoritism, or systematic distortion in information, arguments, or their presentation.";
    rdfs:comment "detecting selective use of data in a report, or identifying loaded language in a historical account.";
    edu:specializes :Evaluation.
:BiasPrevention a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing and limiting biases in one's own reasoning and communication.";
    rdfs:comment "choosing a balanced sample for an investigation, or revising an account to represent differing perspectives fairly.";
    edu:partOf :CommunicationCapability.
:CommunicationCapability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Exchanging, interpreting, and producing information through appropriate modalities to establish shared understanding.";
    rdfs:comment "discussing a proposed solution with a partner, or explaining an investigation's findings to an audience.".
:ConceptClassification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Organizing concepts into categories by their defining attributes, similarities, differences, and relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "classifying triangles by their sides, or classifying words by their grammatical functions.";
    edu:specializes :ConceptualThinking.
:ConceptComposition a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Combining related concepts to form a coherent new or more complex concept.";
    rdfs:comment "combining area and height to explain volume, or combining food chains into the concept of a food web.";
    edu:specializes :ConceptualThinking.
:ConceptDerivation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Inferring a new concept or conceptual relationship from existing knowledge and evidence.";
    rdfs:comment "deriving the concept of a triangle's area from a rectangle, or inferring an unfamiliar word's meaning from its roots and context.";
    edu:specializes :ConceptualThinking.
:ConceptGeneralization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying shared features or principles across instances to form a broader concept applicable beyond those instances.";
    rdfs:comment "forming a polygon definition from several shapes, or generalizing a grammatical pattern from multiple sentences.";
    edu:specializes :ConceptualThinking.
:ConceptSpecification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Refining a general concept into a more specific concept or instance by identifying its distinguishing features.";
    rdfs:comment "specifying a triangle as equilateral, or describing the characteristics of a particular ecosystem within a general ecological model.";
    edu:specializes :ConceptualThinking.
:ConceptualThinking a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding and connecting concepts through their underlying attributes, principles, and relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "connecting multiplication with equal groups, or relating energy transfer across different physical processes.";
    edu:partOf :AnalyticalCapability.
:ConvergentCreativity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Combining different ideas or perspectives into a coherent solution that meets a shared purpose or set of constraints.";
    rdfs:comment "combining several proposed layouts into a workable model, or integrating different story ideas into one consistent plot.";
    edu:specializes :CreativeCapability.
:CreativeCapability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Generating original and useful ideas, interpretations, or solutions within a given context.";
    rdfs:comment "devising a new way to represent a mathematical relationship, or developing an original ending to a story.".
:DeductiveReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Drawing conclusions that necessarily follow from stated premises through valid reasoning.";
    rdfs:comment "concluding that a square has four right angles from the properties of rectangles, or deriving a prediction from a stated scientific law. The guarantee depends on the premises being true and the inference being valid.";
    edu:specializes :LogicalReasoning.
:DialogModeration a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Guiding a conversation so participants can exchange views, remain focused, and respond constructively to one another.";
    rdfs:comment "moderating a discussion of competing solutions, or helping participants resolve a disagreement about a text.";
    edu:specializes :Facilitation.
:DirectUnderstanding a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Comprehending information's explicitly stated or directly represented meaning.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying a value explicitly given in a table, or restating the literal instructions in a passage.";
    edu:specializes :Understanding.
:DivergentCreativity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Generating multiple distinct ideas or possible solutions before selecting an approach.";
    rdfs:comment "proposing different ways to arrange shapes into a figure, or brainstorming alternative explanations for an observation.";
    edu:specializes :CreativeCapability.
:DiversityTolerance a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Responding respectfully to differences in people's backgrounds, perspectives, and practices.";
    rdfs:comment "comparing cultural accounts without dismissing unfamiliar practices, or considering a classmate's different approach during group work.";
    edu:partOf :SocialScaling.
:EmotionalCapability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing, interpreting, regulating, and expressing emotions in oneself and in interactions with others.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a character's emotional response, or selecting a constructive response to frustration during a collaborative task.".
:EmotionalCreativity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Using emotional awareness and expression to develop original ideas or creative work.";
    rdfs:comment "using color and composition to express a mood, or writing a scene from an unfamiliar emotional perspective.";
    edu:specializes :CreativeCapability.
:Emotionalization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Conveying emotion intentionally through the content and delivery of communication.";
    rdfs:comment "using vocal emphasis in a persuasive speech, or choosing imagery to convey a narrator's excitement.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:EmotionExtraction a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying emotions conveyed by verbal, visual, or other communicative evidence.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying a character's anxiety from dialogue and actions, or identifying the emotion conveyed by a performed scene.";
    edu:specializes :Extraction.
:Empathy a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding another person's feelings and perspective and considering an appropriate response.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining how a character experiences a conflict, or considering a partner's frustration when planning a shared task.";
    edu:partOf :EmotionalCapability.
:ErrorCorrection a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "The complete process of detecting, evaluating, and resolving an error.";
    rdfs:comment "locating an error in a calculation, explaining its cause, and verifying a correction; or applying the same sequence to an experimental procedure.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:ErrorDetection a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing a mistake, inconsistency, or conflict with a stated requirement or established fact.";
    rdfs:comment "spotting a sign error in a calculation, or identifying a contradiction within an argument.";
    edu:partOf :ErrorCorrection;
    edu:specializes :Evaluation.
:ErrorEvaluation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Characterizing the nature, cause, and consequences of a detected error.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining why a calculation failed, or determining how a measurement error affects an experimental conclusion.";
    edu:partOf :ErrorCorrection;
    edu:specializes :Evaluation.
:ErrorResolution a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Applying and verifying the change required to eliminate a detected and evaluated error.";
    rdfs:comment "correcting a mistaken calculation and checking the result, or revising an experimental step and confirming that it addresses the identified problem.";
    edu:partOf :ErrorCorrection.
:Evaluation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Judging quality, value, or significance against relevant criteria and evidence.";
    rdfs:comment "assessing a solution against stated conditions, or comparing the credibility of two sources.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:Expression a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Conveying thoughts, feelings, or information in a form that others can interpret.";
    rdfs:comment "representing a relationship in a diagram, or communicating a viewpoint in a speech.";
    edu:partOf :CommunicationCapability.
:Extraction a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying and isolating information or elements relevant to a purpose within a larger source.";
    rdfs:comment "selecting the necessary measurements from a diagram, or locating evidence for a claim in an article.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:Facilitation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Supporting others in carrying out a process, participating in an activity, or reaching a shared goal.";
    rdfs:comment "guiding a group through a problem-solving discussion, or helping partners coordinate an investigation.";
    edu:partOf :CommunicationCapability.
:Formalization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing information according to the formal rules and conventions of a communication context.";
    rdfs:comment "presenting a mathematical argument in a required format, or adapting informal notes into an academic report.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:GesticArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Conveying meaning through deliberate bodily gestures and posture.";
    rdfs:comment "using hand movements to indicate rotation, or using body posture to communicate a character's intention.";
    edu:specializes :Articulation.
:GesticReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting meaning conveyed through bodily gestures and posture.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting a gesture indicating direction, or explaining what an actor's posture communicates.";
    edu:specializes :Reception.
:GrammaticalPrecision a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Applying grammatical rules accurately in speech or writing.";
    rdfs:comment "maintaining agreement in a written explanation, or using correct verb forms during an oral presentation.";
    edu:specializes :TextualArticulation, :VocalArticulation.
:GroupModeration a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Guiding participation, interaction, and coordination within a group working toward a shared purpose.";
    rdfs:comment "distributing turns during a solution discussion, or helping an investigation team agree on roles and next steps.";
    edu:specializes :Facilitation.
:HumoristicInterpretation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing humor and explaining how its meaning arises from language, context, or presentation.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a wordplay-based joke, or identifying the incongruity that makes a scene humorous.";
    edu:specializes :Interpretation.
:HypothesisGeneration a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Formulating testable explanations or predictions from observations and existing knowledge.";
    rdfs:comment "proposing a rule for a number pattern, or predicting how light exposure affects plant growth.";
    edu:partOf :ScientificThinking.
:HypothesisValidation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Evaluating a hypothesis by comparing its predictions with systematically gathered evidence.";
    rdfs:comment "checking a mathematical conjecture against relevant cases, or testing a prediction with controlled observations. Supporting cases alone do not prove an unrestricted mathematical claim.";
    edu:partOf :ScientificThinking.
:InductiveReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Drawing a tentative generalization from particular observations or cases.";
    rdfs:comment "conjecturing a numerical pattern from several instances, or inferring a biological trend from observations. This differs from mathematical induction, which is a deductive proof method.";
    edu:specializes :NonDeductiveReasoning.
:InformationCompression a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Summarizing information while preserving its essential meaning and relevant relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "condensing a multi-step explanation into its main argument, or summarizing a research report without omitting its central qualification.";
    edu:specializes :Interpretation.
:InformationExtraction a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying and gathering specific facts or details relevant to a task from a source.";
    rdfs:comment "retrieving values needed for a calculation from a table, or collecting dates and events from a historical account.";
    edu:specializes :Extraction.
:IntentIdentification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Inferring the purpose of a communication from its content, context, and presentation.";
    rdfs:comment "distinguishing an explanation from a persuasive argument, or identifying what a speaker hopes an audience will do.";
    edu:specializes :Interpretation.
:Interpretation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Explaining meaning by relating information to its context, evidence, and relevant knowledge.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining what a graph implies about a situation, or interpreting a passage in light of its historical context.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:Introspection a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Examining one's own thoughts, feelings, motives, and actions.";
    rdfs:comment "reflecting on why a problem-solving approach was chosen, or explaining how an emotional response affected participation in a discussion.";
    edu:partOf :EmotionalCapability.
:LateralCreativity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Developing unconventional ideas by questioning assumptions and reframing a problem.";
    rdfs:comment "exploring a simple mechanical solution to a problem usually approached electronically, or retelling a story from an unexpected viewpoint.";
    edu:specializes :CreativeCapability.
:LinguisticArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing meaning through the words and structures of a language in speech or writing.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a calculation orally, or writing a coherent account of an investigation.";
    edu:partOf :LinguisticCapability;
    edu:specializes :Articulation.
:LinguisticCapability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Using a language's vocabulary, structures, and contextual conventions to understand and communicate meaning.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting an unfamiliar explanation, or adapting a written account for a particular audience.".
:LinguisticReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding meaning expressed in spoken or written language.";
    rdfs:comment "following an oral explanation, or interpreting written instructions for an experiment.";
    edu:partOf :LinguisticCapability;
    edu:specializes :Reception.
:LogicalInference a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Deriving a conclusion from stated premises by applying valid deductive inference rules.";
    rdfs:comment "applying modus ponens to a conditional statement, or deriving a consequence of a formal model.";
    edu:specializes :DeductiveReasoning.
:LogicalProcessing a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Carrying out an ordered sequence of reasoning operations whose steps are justified by logical relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "following a chain of implications in a proof, or applying a decision procedure to classify observations.";
    edu:partOf :LogicalThinking.
:LogicalReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Using premises and evidence to reach and justify conclusions, with the strength of the conclusion appropriate to the inference.";
    rdfs:comment "deriving a necessary conclusion from stated premises, or comparing explanations supported to different degrees by observations.";
    edu:partOf :LogicalThinking.
:LogicalThinking a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Organizing and examining ideas for consistency, justified relationships, and well-supported conclusions.";
    rdfs:comment "checking the consistency of a solution, or distinguishing a supported conclusion from an unsupported claim in a report.";
    edu:partOf :AnalyticalCapability.
:MessageExtraction a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying the central point or message within a communication.";
    rdfs:comment "stating the main claim of a mathematical explanation, or identifying the central message of a speech.";
    edu:specializes :Extraction.
:Messaging a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Communicating information or instructions clearly for a particular purpose and audience.";
    rdfs:comment "writing directions for a construction task, or explaining what a group should do during an investigation.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:MimicArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Conveying meaning or emotion through deliberate facial expressions.";
    rdfs:comment "portraying a character's surprise without words, or using facial expression to support the intended meaning of a spoken line.";
    edu:specializes :Articulation.
:MimicReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting meaning or emotion conveyed through facial expressions.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a character's reaction in an illustrated scene, or interpreting an actor's changing expression.";
    edu:specializes :Reception.
:MoodIdentification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying the prevailing emotional tone of a communication or represented situation.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining how a passage creates a tense atmosphere, or identifying the mood conveyed by music and imagery in a scene.";
    edu:specializes :Interpretation.
:Narration a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Communicating a connected sequence of events as a coherent story or account.";
    rdfs:comment "recounting the stages of an investigation, or telling a story with a clear sequence and viewpoint.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:NarrativeExtraction a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying the events, participants, and relationships that form the underlying narrative of a communication.";
    rdfs:comment "reconstructing a sequence of historical events from several sources, or identifying a story's central conflict and resolution.";
    edu:specializes :Extraction.
:NonDeductiveReasoning a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Drawing conclusions supported to some degree by premises or evidence without those conclusions being logically guaranteed.";
    rdfs:comment "proposing the most plausible explanation for an observation, or predicting a pattern from previously examined cases.";
    edu:specializes :LogicalReasoning.
:PassiveVocabulary a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding the meanings of words encountered in speech or writing, whether or not those words are actively used.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting a technical term in a science passage, or explaining an unfamiliar word encountered in a story.";
    edu:specializes :LinguisticReception.
:PeerAwareness a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing peers' feelings, needs, and perspectives from available interpersonal evidence.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying a partner's difficulty during a shared task, or explaining different participants' concerns in a group discussion.";
    edu:partOf :Empathy.
:PeerRelatability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Establishing understanding and rapport with peers by recognizing shared experiences and differing perspectives.";
    rdfs:comment "relating a partner's explanation to a shared experience, or adapting a response to acknowledge a classmate's viewpoint.";
    edu:partOf :Empathy.
:PeerSupport a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Offering appropriate encouragement, assistance, or guidance to peers in response to their needs.";
    rdfs:comment "helping a partner identify the next step in a task, or responding constructively when a group member encounters difficulty.";
    edu:partOf :Empathy.
:Performance a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Presenting oneself or one's work to an audience through deliberate, expressive delivery.";
    rdfs:comment "performing a dramatic scene, or delivering a practiced explanation of a project to an audience.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:PlausibilityEvaluation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Judging how credible or likely a claim is in light of the available evidence and context.";
    rdfs:comment "assessing whether a calculated measurement is realistic, or comparing the plausibility of two explanations for an event.";
    edu:specializes :Evaluation.
:PoliticalAwareness a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing how political institutions, decisions, interests, and power relationships affect a situation.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining how a policy influences a community, or interpreting the competing interests represented in a historical debate.";
    edu:partOf :SocialScaling.
:Presentation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Organizing and delivering information in a coherent form suited to a purpose and audience.";
    rdfs:comment "presenting the reasoning behind a solution, or reporting an investigation's findings with an organized sequence of supporting material.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:ProcedureApplicability a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Judging whether a procedure's purpose, assumptions, and conditions make it suitable for a task.";
    rdfs:comment "deciding whether a conversion method applies to the given units, or whether an experimental procedure can test a stated hypothesis.";
    edu:specializes :ProcedureUnderstanding.
:ProcedureApplication a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Selecting and using a procedure suited to a task's conditions and intended outcome.";
    rdfs:comment "selecting and using a method to solve an equation, or choosing and carrying out an appropriate measurement procedure.";
    edu:partOf :LogicalProcessing.
:ProcedureComposition a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Combining or adapting known procedures into a coherent procedure for a new or more complex task.";
    rdfs:comment "combining area calculations to measure a composite figure, or combining sampling and measurement procedures into an investigation.";
    edu:specializes :ProcedureUnderstanding.
:ProcedureDerivation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Developing a procedure from underlying principles, relationships, or previously established procedures.";
    rdfs:comment "deriving a method for finding a triangle's area, or deriving an experimental sequence from a model's predictions.";
    edu:specializes :ProcedureUnderstanding.
:ProcedureExecution a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Carrying out the steps of a procedure accurately and in the required order.";
    rdfs:comment "carrying out a supplied calculation algorithm, or following an experimental protocol. Execution alone does not establish that the learner selected or derived the procedure.";
    edu:partOf :ProcedureApplication.
:ProcedureIdentification a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing which known procedure matches a task's features and intended outcome.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying a suitable algorithm for a calculation, or naming the procedure needed to measure a specimen's volume.";
    edu:partOf :ProcedureApplication.
:ProcedureInversion a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Working backward through a procedure from a known outcome to determine an unknown input or intermediate state using the relationships between its steps.";
    rdfs:comment "recovering an original number from the result of stated operations, or reconstructing an earlier state in a described experimental sequence. Steps must supply enough information for the requested reconstruction.";
    edu:specializes :ProcedureUnderstanding.
:ProcedureMemorization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Remembering and recalling the ordered steps, rules, and conditions of a procedure.";
    rdfs:comment "recalling an algorithm's steps without consulting instructions, or reciting the sequence of an experimental protocol.";
    edu:partOf :ProcedureApplication.
:ProcedureUnderstanding a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Explaining how and why a procedure's steps, order, and conditions produce its intended outcome.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining why regrouping works in an arithmetic algorithm, or why a control step is necessary in an experiment.";
    edu:partOf :LogicalProcessing.
:Processing a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Working with information to identify its meaning, assess it, and use it for a purpose.";
    rdfs:comment "organizing the information in a word problem, or evaluating and interpreting evidence in a report.";
    edu:partOf :CommunicationCapability.
:Pronunciation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Producing spoken words with the sounds, stress, and articulation appropriate to the language and intended meaning.";
    rdfs:comment "pronouncing subject terminology clearly in a presentation, or distinguishing similar words through their spoken sounds.";
    edu:specializes :VocalArticulation.
:ReadingFluency a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Reading connected text smoothly and accurately with phrasing that supports comprehension.";
    rdfs:comment "reading a passage with coherent phrase grouping, or reading instructions without pauses that obscure their meaning.";
    edu:specializes :TextualReception.
:ReadingPrecision a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Reading accurately enough to retain the details, qualifications, and relationships expressed in a text.";
    rdfs:comment "noticing an exception in written problem conditions, or distinguishing a source's claim from its qualification.";
    edu:specializes :TextualReception.
:ReadingSpeed a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Reading at a pace that supports efficient access to information while retaining comprehension.";
    rdfs:comment "locating and understanding relevant material within a timed reading task, or reading instructions efficiently before applying them.";
    edu:specializes :TextualReception.
:Reception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Receiving and interpreting information through a perceptual or communicative modality.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting a spoken explanation, or understanding a diagram's information.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:RelevanceEvaluation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Determining how information contributes to a stated question, task, or purpose.";
    rdfs:comment "selecting the quantities needed to solve a word problem, or distinguishing relevant evidence from background detail in an argument.";
    edu:specializes :Evaluation.
:ResultInterpretation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Explaining what results mean in relation to the question, assumptions, and evidence that produced them.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting a calculated value in a problem's context, or explaining what an experiment's results support and what remains uncertain.";
    edu:partOf :ScientificThinking.
:ScientificThinking a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Investigating questions systematically through testable hypotheses, evidence gathering, analysis, and revision of explanations.";
    rdfs:comment "testing a proposed relationship between quantities, or comparing a model's predictions with observations.";
    edu:partOf :AnalyticalCapability.
:SelfAssessment a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Evaluating one's own knowledge, skills, or performance against relevant evidence and criteria.";
    rdfs:comment "checking a solution against a rubric, or identifying strengths and weaknesses in a recorded presentation.";
    edu:partOf :Introspection.
:SelfAwareness a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing one's own thoughts, emotions, and responses and how they affect actions.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying frustration during problem solving, or explaining how assumptions influenced an interpretation.";
    edu:partOf :Introspection.
:SelfConfidence a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Trust in one's capacity to attempt a task and make judgments while acknowledging uncertainty and limitations.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining why one is prepared to attempt an unfamiliar task, or reflecting on the reasons for confidence in a proposed approach. Task completion alone does not establish this attribute.";
    edu:partOf :Introspection.
:SelfMotivation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Initiating and sustaining purposeful effort toward a goal without relying entirely on external direction.";
    rdfs:comment "setting and following a personal investigation goal, or planning independent practice in response to a self-identified need.";
    edu:partOf :Introspection.
:SelfRegulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Monitoring and adjusting one's attention, emotions, and actions to meet a task's demands.";
    rdfs:comment "changing a study strategy after noticing distraction, or managing frustration while revising a solution.";
    edu:partOf :Introspection.
:ServiceOrientation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Recognizing opportunities to help others and choosing actions that contribute to a shared or community need.";
    rdfs:comment "planning a project around a community's stated needs, or selecting a supportive role in a collaborative activity.";
    edu:partOf :SocialScaling.
:SocialScaling a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Adapting one's behavior and communication to the participants, expectations, and relationships of a social context.";
    rdfs:comment "changing an explanation for a younger audience, or adjusting participation when moving from a pair discussion to a group debate.";
    edu:partOf :EmotionalCapability.
:SpatialGeneration a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Creating or transforming spatial arrangements and reasoning about the resulting structures and relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "arranging component shapes into a new figure, or designing a layout that meets stated spatial constraints.";
    edu:specializes :SpatialThinking.
:SpatialImagination a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Forming and manipulating mental representations of spatial objects and relationships without physically transforming the objects.";
    rdfs:comment "predicting the result of rotating a solid, or imagining how a folded net will look when assembled.";
    edu:specializes :SpatialThinking.
:SpatialInterpretation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting spatial information by relating its symbols, scale, orientation, and arrangement to the represented objects or space.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting a map's distances and directions, or explaining the relationships shown in a geometric diagram.";
    edu:specializes :SpatialThinking.
:SpatialNavigation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Planning and following a route through physical or represented space using positions, directions, and spatial cues.";
    rdfs:comment "tracing a route on a map, or describing movements through a three-dimensional model.";
    edu:specializes :SpatialThinking.
:SpatialThinking a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Representing and reasoning about objects' positions, dimensions, orientations, and spatial relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "comparing objects under rotation, or reasoning about relative locations in a plan.";
    edu:partOf :AnalyticalCapability.
:SpeakingFluency a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Producing connected speech smoothly, with phrasing and continuity that support understanding.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a solution without disruptive hesitations, or recounting an event in coherent spoken phrases.";
    edu:specializes :VocalArticulation.
:SpeakingSpeed a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Adjusting the pace of speech to the message, audience, and communicative situation.";
    rdfs:comment "slowing an explanation at a difficult step, or adjusting delivery to make spoken instructions easy to follow.";
    edu:specializes :VocalArticulation.
:SubtextUnderstanding a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting meaning implied by a communication beyond what it explicitly states.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying an unstated criticism in a dialogue, or explaining how tone changes the meaning of a spoken response.";
    edu:specializes :Understanding.
:SupertextUnderstanding a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting a communication in relation to broader knowledge, context, and implications.";
    rdfs:comment "relating a historical passage to its political setting, or explaining how a scientific account connects with earlier findings.";
    edu:specializes :Understanding.
:SyntacticalPrecision a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Constructing written sentences whose arrangement of words and clauses expresses the intended relationships clearly and correctly.";
    rdfs:comment "revising an ambiguous explanation by changing clause order, or constructing a sentence that clearly identifies a cause and its consequence.";
    edu:specializes :TextualArticulation.
:TextualArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing meaning clearly through written language and its organizational conventions.";
    rdfs:comment "writing an explanation of a solution, or producing a coherent account of an investigation.";
    edu:specializes :LinguisticArticulation.
:TextualReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding meaning conveyed through written language.";
    rdfs:comment "interpreting written problem conditions, or explaining the argument developed in an article.";
    edu:specializes :LinguisticReception.
:TonalArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Conveying meaning or emotion through deliberate control of vocal pitch, intensity, and inflection.";
    rdfs:comment "emphasizing a contrast during an explanation, or changing vocal inflection to convey a character's uncertainty.";
    edu:specializes :Articulation.
:TonalReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting meaning or emotion conveyed by vocal pitch, intensity, and inflection.";
    rdfs:comment "recognizing a question from its spoken intonation, or explaining how a performer's tone conveys doubt.";
    edu:specializes :Reception.
:Understanding a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Grasping information's meaning and relating it to relevant ideas or contexts.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a mathematical statement in one's own words, or relating a passage's meaning to its context.";
    edu:partOf :Processing.
:VisualArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Communicating meaning clearly through the deliberate organization and presentation of visual elements.";
    rdfs:comment "arranging a diagram so relationships are clear, or designing an image that communicates a particular message.";
    edu:specializes :Articulation.
:VisualDecomposition a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Separating a visual representation into meaningful components and interpreting how they contribute to the whole.";
    rdfs:comment "identifying component shapes in a figure, or separating the layers of information in a map.";
    edu:specializes :VisualReception.
:Visualization a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Externalizing concepts, relationships, processes, or data as visual representations that communicate their structure or meaning.";
    rdfs:comment "drawing a graph to communicate a numerical relationship, or constructing a diagram of a biological process.";
    edu:specializes :Expression.
:VisualReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Interpreting information conveyed by visual forms and their relationships.";
    rdfs:comment "explaining a graph's information, or interpreting the sequence represented in a diagram.";
    edu:specializes :Reception.
:VisualRecognition a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Identifying familiar visual forms or patterns by relating their features to previously encountered representations.";
    rdfs:comment "recognizing a shape despite a changed orientation, or identifying a familiar symbol within a diagram.";
    edu:specializes :VisualReception.
:VocalArticulation a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Expressing meaning clearly through spoken language.";
    rdfs:comment "giving understandable oral instructions, or explaining the reasoning behind a conclusion aloud.";
    edu:specializes :LinguisticArticulation.
:VocalListeningCapacity a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Sustaining attention and comprehension across an extended spoken communication.";
    rdfs:comment "following a multi-stage oral explanation, or retaining the argument across a sustained discussion.";
    edu:specializes :VocalReception.
:VocalListeningFlexibility a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding spoken language across variations in accent, speaking style, and delivery.";
    rdfs:comment "following explanations by speakers with different accents, or adapting to a speaker's changing pace.";
    edu:specializes :VocalReception.
:VocalListeningPrecision a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Distinguishing and retaining the details and qualifications conveyed in spoken language.";
    rdfs:comment "following oral instructions that distinguish similar quantities, or identifying a qualification in a spoken argument.";
    edu:specializes :VocalReception.
:VocalReception a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Understanding meaning conveyed through spoken language.";
    rdfs:comment "following a spoken explanation of a method, or interpreting an oral account of an event.";
    edu:specializes :LinguisticReception.
:WritingFluency a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Producing connected written language smoothly while maintaining coherent expression.";
    rdfs:comment "writing an explanation without interruptions that disrupt its structure, or developing a connected narrative from a prompt.";
    edu:specializes :TextualArticulation.
:WritingSpeed a owl:NamedIndividual, edu:Ability;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "Producing written language at a pace suited to a task while maintaining legibility or readability and intended meaning.";
    rdfs:comment "recording understandable notes during an explanation, or completing a coherent written response within an allotted time.";
    edu:specializes :TextualArticulation.
